# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev` of the sveltia-cms-auth Worker.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and paste the values from the GitHub OAuth App
# page. Leave no real secret in this example file. In production these are set with
# `wrangler secret put ...`, never read from a file.
#
# Fill the two keys below (format: KEY=value, no quotes needed):
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
